    {
      "id": 200,
      "type": "row",
      "title": "Kubernetes — namespace urbanconnect",
      "collapsed": false,
      "gridPos": {
        "h": 1,
        "w": 24,
        "x": 0,
        "y": 19
      },
      "panels": []
    },
    {
      "id": 20,
      "type": "timeseries",
      "title": "CPU par pod, en part de sa limite",
      "description": "Un pod au-dessus de 100 % de sa limite CPU est **étranglé** par le noyau : il n'est pas tué, il ralentit. ⚠️ Les pods **sans limite** n'apparaissent pas ici — la division ne trouve pas de dénominateur. La table « Conteneurs sans limite » plus bas les liste, et c'est précisément pour ça qu'elle existe.",
      "datasource": {
        "type": "prometheus",
        "uid": "prometheus"
      },
      "gridPos": {
        "h": 7,
        "w": 12,
        "x": 0,
        "y": 20
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "refId": "A",
          "datasource": {
            "type": "prometheus",
            "uid": "prometheus"
          },
          "expr": "topk(12, sum by (pod) (rate(container_cpu_usage_seconds_total{namespace=\"urbanconnect\", container!=\"\"}[5m])) / sum by (pod) (kube_pod_container_resource_limits{namespace=\"urbanconnect\", resource=\"cpu\"}))",
          "legendFormat": "{{pod}}"
        }
      ],
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "unit": "percentunit",
          "decimals": 2,
          "min": 0,
          "custom": {
            "drawStyle": "line",
            "lineWidth": 2,
            "fillOpacity": 0,
            "showPoints": "never",
            "thresholdsStyle": {
              "mode": "line"
            }
          },
          "thresholds": {
            "mode": "absolute",
            "steps": [
              {
                "color": "green",
                "value": null
              },
              {
                "color": "orange",
                "value": 0.8
              },
              {
                "color": "red",
                "value": 1
              }
            ]
          }
        },
        "overrides": []
      },
      "options": {
        "legend": {
          "displayMode": "table",
          "placement": "right",
          "calcs": [
            "mean",
            "max",
            "lastNotNull"
          ]
        },
        "tooltip": {
          "mode": "multi",
          "sort": "desc"
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "id": 21,
      "type": "timeseries",
      "title": "Mémoire par pod, en part de sa limite",
      "description": "Contrairement au CPU, dépasser la limite mémoire **tue le conteneur** (OOMKill). Le seuil de l'alerte `HighMemoryUsage` est à 85 %, volontairement sous la barre fatale. Mêmes absents que le panneau CPU : les conteneurs sans limite.",
      "datasource": {
        "type": "prometheus",
        "uid": "prometheus"
      },
      "gridPos": {
        "h": 7,
        "w": 12,
        "x": 12,
        "y": 20
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "refId": "A",
          "datasource": {
            "type": "prometheus",
            "uid": "prometheus"
          },
          "expr": "topk(12, sum by (pod) (container_memory_working_set_bytes{namespace=\"urbanconnect\", container!=\"\"}) / sum by (pod) (kube_pod_container_resource_limits{namespace=\"urbanconnect\", resource=\"memory\"}))",
          "legendFormat": "{{pod}}"
        }
      ],
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "unit": "percentunit",
          "decimals": 2,
          "min": 0,
          "custom": {
            "drawStyle": "line",
            "lineWidth": 2,
            "fillOpacity": 0,
            "showPoints": "never",
            "thresholdsStyle": {
              "mode": "line"
            }
          },
          "thresholds": {
            "mode": "absolute",
            "steps": [
              {
                "color": "green",
                "value": null
              },
              {
                "color": "orange",
                "value": 0.85
              },
              {
                "color": "red",
                "value": 1
              }
            ]
          }
        },
        "overrides": []
      },
      "options": {
        "legend": {
          "displayMode": "table",
          "placement": "right",
          "calcs": [
            "mean",
            "max",
            "lastNotNull"
          ]
        },
        "tooltip": {
          "mode": "multi",
          "sort": "desc"
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "id": 22,
      "type": "table",
      "title": "Pods non prêts",
      "description": "⚠️ Le `unless` sur les pods `Succeeded` n'est pas décoratif : un pod de Job terminé avec succès garde `Ready=false` **pour toujours**. Sans lui, quatre pods terminés (geoipupdate ×2, elasticsearch-setup, minio-init) figuraient ici en permanence — et une liste qui n'est jamais vide apprend à ne plus être lue.",
      "datasource": {
        "type": "prometheus",
        "uid": "prometheus"
      },
      "gridPos": {
        "h": 7,
        "w": 8,
        "x": 0,
        "y": 27
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "refId": "A",
          "datasource": {
            "type": "prometheus",
            "uid": "prometheus"
          },
          "expr": "kube_pod_status_ready{namespace=\"urbanconnect\", condition=\"false\"} == 1\nunless on(namespace, pod)\nkube_pod_status_phase{namespace=\"urbanconnect\", phase=\"Succeeded\"} == 1",
          "instant": true,
          "format": "table"
        }
      ],
      "transformations": [
        {
          "id": "organize",
          "options": {
            "excludeByName": {
              "Time": true,
              "Value": true,
              "__name__": true,
              "condition": true,
              "endpoint": true,
              "container": true,
              "instance": true,
              "job": true,
              "service": true,
              "uid": true
            },
            "renameByName": {
              "pod": "Pod",
              "namespace": "Namespace"
            }
          }
        }
      ],
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "custom": {
            "align": "left"
          }
        },
        "overrides": []
      },
      "options": {
        "showHeader": true,
        "footer": {
          "show": false,
          "reducer": [
            "sum"
          ]
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "id": 23,
      "type": "table",
      "title": "Conteneurs sans limite mémoire",
      "description": "Un conteneur sans limite peut consommer toute la mémoire du nœud et faire tuer **ses voisins** à sa place. Il échappe aussi aux deux panneaux de ratio ci-dessus et à l'alerte `HighMemoryUsage` — il est donc invisible partout ailleurs. 14 conteneurs étaient dans ce cas au 2026-09-02.",
      "datasource": {
        "type": "prometheus",
        "uid": "prometheus"
      },
      "gridPos": {
        "h": 7,
        "w": 8,
        "x": 8,
        "y": 27
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "refId": "A",
          "datasource": {
            "type": "prometheus",
            "uid": "prometheus"
          },
          "expr": "kube_pod_container_status_running{namespace=\"urbanconnect\"}\nunless on(namespace, pod, container)\nkube_pod_container_resource_limits{namespace=\"urbanconnect\", resource=\"memory\"}",
          "instant": true,
          "format": "table"
        }
      ],
      "transformations": [
        {
          "id": "organize",
          "options": {
            "excludeByName": {
              "Time": true,
              "Value": true,
              "__name__": true,
              "endpoint": true,
              "instance": true,
              "job": true,
              "service": true,
              "uid": true
